= <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> unbanned!


While both parties were banned alongside the <span style="color: [+ nsdap_colour +];">**NSDAP**</span> but they appear less controversial to the government. There might be an effort to draw voters away from clandestine <span style="color: [+ nsdap_colour +];">**NSDAP**</span> organisations and drive a wedge between the unforeseen working-middle-class coalition - since the <span style="color: [+ kpd_colour +];">**KPD**</span> is largely proletarian and the <span style="color: #3D3D3D;">**DVFP**</span> fairly bourgeois...
























